on-arrival: if (typeof Q.inflation !== 'number') Q.inflation = 65; if (typeof Q.public_support !== 'number') Q.public_support = 50; if (typeof Q.security !== 'number') Q.security = 45; if (typeof Q.stability !== 'number') Q.stability = 55; if (typeof Q.month !== 'number') Q.month = 12; if (typeof Q.year !== 'number') Q.year = 1969; if (typeof Q.party_name !== 'string') Q.party_name = 'Not selected'; if (typeof Q.resources !== 'number') Q.resources = 4; if (typeof Q.dissent !== 'string') Q.dissent = 'Moderate'; if (typeof Q.government_position !== 'string') Q.government_position = 'Governing coalition';

ANNI DI PIOMBO

ITALY, DECEMBER 1969

A political strategy game set during Italy's Years of Lead.

The Italian Republic faces political violence, industrial unrest, economic uncertainty and a crisis of confidence in democratic institutions. Choose a party, manage your government, and face the consequences of your decisions.

- @party_select: Start Game
- @credits: Credits
- @achievements: Achievements

@party_select
title: Choose Your Party
new-page: true

ITALIAN REPUBLIC — DECEMBER 1969

Choose the political organisation you will lead. After choosing, you will go directly to the government card hand.

- @dc_start: Democrazia Cristiana (DC)
- @pci_start: Partito Comunista Italiano (PCI)
- @psi_start: Partito Socialista Italiano (PSI)
- @msi_start: Movimento Sociale Italiano (MSI)
