@economic_relief
title: Economic Relief
is-card: true
new-page: true
choose-if: resources >= 1
tags: policy_deck

Your party advances emergency economic measures intended to ease pressure on households and restore confidence.

- @economic_relief_result: Introduce relief measures

@economic_relief_result
title: Economic Relief
new-page: true

on-arrival: Q.resources = Math.max(0, Q.resources - 1); Q.inflation = Math.max(0, Q.inflation - 8); Q.public_support = Math.min(100, Q.public_support + 5);

Your party's economic programme gains traction. The economic pressure index falls and public support improves.

- @monthly_briefing: Return to government

@public_security
title: Public Security
is-card: true
new-page: true
choose-if: resources >= 1
tags: policy_deck

Your party must respond to political violence while defending its position on public order and the institutions of the Republic.

- @public_security_result: Strengthen public security

@public_security_result
title: Public Security
new-page: true

on-arrival: Q.resources = Math.max(0, Q.resources - 1); Q.security = Math.min(100, Q.security + 10); Q.stability = Math.min(100, Q.stability + 3);

Your party's public-security initiative improves the security index, though the long-term political consequences remain uncertain.

- @monthly_briefing: Return to government

